        "en": "This will be the final exercise of the session."
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "session",
      "id": "one_minute_left",
      "text": {
        "es": "Queda aproximadamente un minuto.",
        "en": "About one minute remains."
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "session",
      "id": "section_complete",
      "text": {
        "es": "Esta parte ha finalizado.",
        "en": "This section is complete."
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "session",
      "id": "session_almost_done",
      "text": {
        "es": "Estamos llegando al final de la sesión.",
        "en": "We are approaching the end of the session."
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "cq_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "CQ es una llamada general. Se utiliza para indicar que estás buscando cualquier estación disponible para establecer un contacto.",
        "en": "CQ is a general call. It is used to indicate that you are looking for any available station to make a contact."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "cq"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "cq_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "CQ, llamada general.",
        "en": "CQ, general call."
      },
      "concept": "cq",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "de_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "DE significa de o desde. En CW se utiliza para identificar quién está transmitiendo.",
        "en": "DE means from. In CW it is used to identify the station that is transmitting."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "de"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "de_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "DE, identifica a la estación que transmite.",
        "en": "DE, identifies the transmitting station."
      },
      "concept": "de",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "k_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "K indica que has terminado de transmitir e invitas a cualquier estación a responder.",
        "en": "K indicates that you have finished transmitting and invite any station to respond."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "k"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "k_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "K, cambio abierto para responder.",
        "en": "K, open invitation to respond."
      },
      "concept": "k",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "kn_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "KN indica que has terminado de transmitir y esperas respuesta únicamente de la estación con la que estás comunicando.",
        "en": "KN indicates that you have finished transmitting and expect a reply only from the station you are working."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "kn"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "kn_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "KN, respuesta únicamente de la estación llamada.",
        "en": "KN, reply only from the called station."
      },
      "concept": "kn",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "r_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "R significa recibido o entendido.",
        "en": "R means received or understood."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "r"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "r_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "R, recibido.",
        "en": "R, received."
      },
      "concept": "r",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "bt_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "BT es un prosign utilizado habitualmente como separador entre partes de un mensaje. Debes escucharlo como una sola unidad.",
        "en": "BT is a prosign commonly used as a separator between parts of a message. Listen to it as one complete unit."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "bt"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "bt_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "BT, separador.",
        "en": "BT, separator."
      },
      "concept": "bt",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "ar_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "AR es un prosign que indica el final de un mensaje.",
        "en": "AR is a prosign that indicates the end of a message."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "ar"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "ar_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "AR, final del mensaje.",
        "en": "AR, end of message."
      },
      "concept": "ar",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "sk_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "SK es un prosign que indica el final del contacto o de la comunicación.",
        "en": "SK is a prosign that indicates the end of the contact or communication."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "sk"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "sk_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "SK, final del contacto.",
        "en": "SK, end of contact."
      },
      "concept": "sk",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "rst_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "RST es el reporte de señal. Sus letras representan legibilidad, intensidad y tono.",
        "en": "RST is the signal report. Its letters stand for readability, strength, and tone."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "rst"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "rst_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "RST, reporte de señal.",
        "en": "RST, signal report."
      },
      "concept": "rst",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "qth_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "QTH se refiere a tu ubicación o lugar de operación.",
        "en": "QTH refers to your location or operating position."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "qth"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "qth_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "QTH, ubicación.",
        "en": "QTH, location."
      },
      "concept": "qth",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "name_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "NAME se utiliza habitualmente para indicar o solicitar el nombre del operador.",
        "en": "NAME is commonly used to indicate or request the operator's name."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "name"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "name_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "NAME, nombre del operador.",
        "en": "NAME, operator name."
      },
      "concept": "name",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "73_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "73 significa mejores deseos y se utiliza habitualmente al despedirse en radio.",
        "en": "73 means best regards and is commonly used when signing off on the radio."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "73"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "73_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "73, mejores deseos.",
        "en": "73, best regards."
      },
      "concept": "73",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "599_full",
      "text": {
        "es": "Cinco nueve nueve es un reporte RST muy habitual. Indica máxima legibilidad, gran intensidad de señal y tono perfecto.",
        "en": "Five nine nine is a very common RST report. It indicates perfect readability, strong signal strength, and perfect tone."
      },
      "first_use_only": true,
      "concept": "599"
    },
    {
      "category": "nomenclature",
      "id": "599_short",
      "text": {
        "es": "Cinco nueve nueve, reporte RST.",
        "en": "Five nine nine, RST report."
      },
      "concept": "599",
      "max_uses": 2
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "lesson_welcome_generic",
      "text": {
        "es": "Bienvenido nuevamente a Morse Practice. Hoy continuaremos desarrollando tu reconocimiento de CW.",
        "en": "Welcome back to Morse Practice. Today we will continue developing your CW recognition."
      },
      "use": [
        "course"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "lesson_new_characters_generic",
      "text": {
        "es": "En esta lección incorporarás nuevos caracteres y reforzarás los que ya conoces.",
        "en": "In this lesson you will add new characters and reinforce the ones you already know."
      },
      "use": [
        "course"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "lesson_consolidation",
      "text": {
        "es": "Hoy no incorporaremos nuevos caracteres. Nos concentraremos en consolidar lo que ya has aprendido.",
        "en": "Today we will not add new characters. We will focus on consolidating what you have already learned."
      },
      "use": [
        "course"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "milestone_all_letters",
      "text": {
        "es": "Ya conoces todas las letras. A partir de ahora nos concentraremos en reconocerlas con menos esfuerzo y en combinarlas de forma natural.",
        "en": "You now know all the letters. From now on we will focus on recognizing them with less effort and combining them naturally."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "milestone_numbers_begin",
      "text": {
        "es": "Hoy comenzaremos con los números. Los aprenderás exactamente como aprendiste las letras: por su sonido.",
        "en": "Today we will begin with numbers. You will learn them exactly as you learned the letters: by their sound."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "milestone_callsigns_begin",
      "text": {
        "es": "Hoy damos un paso importante. Comenzaremos a escuchar indicativos completos, tal como aparecen realmente en el aire.",
        "en": "Today we take an important step. We will begin listening to complete call signs, just as they appear on the air."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "milestone_operating_begin",
      "text": {
        "es": "A partir de ahora comenzarás a utilizar los caracteres que has aprendido para entender elementos reales de una comunicación en CW.",
        "en": "From now on you will begin using the characters you have learned to understand real elements of a CW contact."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "milestone_first_qso",
      "text": {
        "es": "Has llegado a una parte especial del curso. Ahora escucharás y comprenderás un QSO básico completo.",
        "en": "You have reached a special part of the course. You will now hear and understand a complete basic QSO."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "category": "course",
      "id": "course_final_message",
      "text": {
        "es": "Si llegaste hasta aquí, ya no estás aprendiendo símbolos aislados. Estás escuchando CW. Ahora comienza la parte más divertida: usarlo en el aire.",
        "en": "If you made it this far, you are no longer learning isolated symbols. You are listening to CW. Now the most enjoyable part begins: using it on the air."
      },
      "use": [
        "course",
        "milestone"
      ]
    },
